"As dieselfde nommer 3 keer in 5 minute bel, stel die volume op maksimum."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:308
msgid "Manage contacts that always play sound"
msgstr "Bestuur kontakte wat altyd klank speel"

